DESCRIPTION:Ryan Goodcase is a stand up comedian who has been praised for h
 is smart writing and dry delivery. In 2019\, Ryan became the youngest perso
 n to win the World Series of Comedy. Since then\, he has also won the 45th 
 San Francisco International Comedy Competition in 2021. He was one of nine 
 comedians selected to be the 2024 Netflix is a Joke Fest's "Introducing\,
 ” a showcase of the next great talents in comedy. A clip from his Netflix
  Is a Joke’s Introducing… set had an amazing viral moment a few months 
 back and currently has over 47M views. His Don't Tell Comedy set was releas
 ed June 2024. You may also recognize him as the actor playing an apathetic 
 Bed\, Bath & Beyond employee in a series of comedic online commercials. His
  debut comedy special\, “Maybe They're Dead” can be streamed online.\n\
